The Stormlord invokes the Wrath of the Storm, unleashing divine lightning upon all nearby enemies and summoning a torrential downpour. Instantly strike every hostile creature within a 60-foot radius with the current effets of Thunderous Smite. Two additional bolts are called down upon all affected opponents within the next 2 rounds.~

@608 = ~Thunderclap~
