The Stormlord unleashes a deafening burst of thunder, disorienting nearby enemies and hindering their movement. 
All enemies within 15 feet are deafened for 3 rounds. If they fail a saving throw vs. death they are also slowed for 2 rounds and knocked unconscious for 1 round.~

