@610 = ~Avatar of Storm~
@611 = ~Avatar of Storm:
For 5 rounds, the Stormlord's electrical resistance is set to 100%, electrical damage dealt is doubled, and resistance to slashing, piercing, crushing, and missile damage is increased by 20%. Fire damage is unaffected.~